    "long_instructions": "# Headings, Paragraphs, and Lists\r\n\r\nThe author of this page added in a lot of content, but did not think about structure.  All of the text is mashed together.\r\n\r\n# Do This:\r\n1) Look through the content with your partner and decide what you think the best structure should be.\r\n2) Add comments to the code to clarify the structure.\r\n3) Use your heading, paragraph, and list tags to code the structure into the page.\r\n\r\n",
