      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html> \n<html>\n  <head>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    My Pets\n    \n    I have three different pets:\n\n    Lula\n    Slowpoke\n    Fluffy\n    \n    They are all my favorite for different reasons. I feed them and give them water every day, and even though it's a lot of work, they are totally worth it.\n    \n    Lula\n\n    Lula's been my dog for two years, and she's really fun to play with.  I like to take her to the park.  Her favorite toy is an old tennis ball.\n    \n    Slowpoke\n\n    Slowpoke is my turtle.  I have had him for as long as I can remember, but he became mine for real when I turned 10 because I promised to take care of him.\n\n    Fluffy\n\n    Fluffy is the name of my fish.  I named him Fluffy because I wanted a cute and fluffy hamster and not a fish, but I like him anyway.  He basically just swims around all day, but I still like him.\n\n  </body>\n</html>",
